    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d358">

                <pb facs="0444" n="1278" xml:id="pg1278"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 658.119/483a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Sweden</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-06-24T10:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 24, 1918, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>882. For Owen [from War Trade Board]:</p>
                <p>No. 20. Your 2270, June 11, 4 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d358-f1"/> Delay to any
                    Swedish steamers here was caused by the action of Swedish Government in failing
                    to name compensation ships as provided for in clause 10 of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">modus vivendi.</hi>
                </p>
                <p>We have just received the cabled advice that Sweden has ratified the permanent
                    agreement and are hastening at once to free the Swedish vessels now loaded with
                    rations here, which will count as part of the rations under the agreement just
                    now become effective by Sweden’s ratification.</p>
                <p>In view of statement of Swedish representatives here that the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Indianic</hi> and <hi rendition="#italic">Australic</hi>
                    are to proceed on Line 1 to Australia, we will allow these vessels to
                    proceed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
